<!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"p-text"} --><p class="p-text">Al-Murabit Security Services working under the Harlow Group is a private security provider that offers a broad portfolio of services to clients in the oil and gas, government, and commercial sectors.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"p-text"} --><p class="p-text">Al-Murabit Security Services provides a range of security services, including armed security, close protection, surveillance, and security consulting. The company also offers a range of other services, such as training, intelligence, and investigations. We have a team of highly experienced and qualified security professionals who are dedicated to providing the highest level of security for their clients.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->
